<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Central considers tender bids.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Central considers tender bids.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's power generation company Central Puerto SA on Monday said it was evaluating the possibility of bidding in the privatization of Brazil's federal power generators Furnas and Eletrosul.</p>
<p>Central Puerto said in a statement to the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange that it was considering placing a bid for Furnas and Eletrosul together with a consortium of companies.</p>
<p>In addition, it said it was looking into bidding in the Argentine tender for the building of an electrical power line from Comahue in the southern province of Patagonia to Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>((--Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
